============================================LEFT VIEW - DFS=============================================================================================================
static int max_lev=0;
    static void dis(node root,int cur_lev)
    {
        
        if(root==null)
            return;
        if(cur_lev > max_lev)
        {
            System.out.print(root.data+" ");
            max_lev=cur_lev;
        }
        dis(root.left,cur_lev+1);            //right - left call -> Right view 
        dis(root.right,cur_lev+1);
    }
====================================================Right VIEW - DFS=========================================================================================
static int max_lev=0;
    static void dis(node root,int cur_lev)
    {
        
        if(root==null)
            return;
        if(cur_lev > max_lev)
        {
            System.out.print(root.data+" ");
            max_lev=cur_lev;
        }
        
        dis(root.right,cur_lev+1);
        dis(root.left,cur_lev+1);
    }
==================================Key Differences===========================================================
Feature	                  Left View 	                      Right View 
Node printed	         First node of level	               Last node of level
Condition	                   i == 0	                            i == n - 1
Traversal order	          Left → Right	                  Left → Right (same!)
Core logic change	     Only the if condition	           Only the if condition
